{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09356","headline":"善福精舍秋夜迟诸君 · 韦应物","name":"善福精舍秋夜迟诸君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广庭独闲步，夜色方湛然。\n丹阁已排云，皓月更高悬。\n繁露降秋节，苍林郁芊芊。\n仰观天气凉，高咏古人篇。\n抚己亮无庸，结交赖羣贤。\n属予翘思时，方子中夜眠。\n相去隔城阙，佳期屡徂迁。\n如何日夕待，见月三四圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}